        {
          "type": "example",
          "title": "A Week That Pulls All Four Levers",
          "content": "Dani, 38, has mild anxiety and low mood and wants to strengthen her foundation alongside her therapy. Here's the week she designs:\n\n- **Move**: 20-minute brisk walk on Monday, Wednesday, and Friday; strength training with resistance bands on Tuesday and Saturday.\n- **Connect**: a standing Thursday phone call with her sister; Saturday coffee with a friend from her old job.\n- **Drink less**: no alcohol Sunday through Thursday; a maximum of two drinks on weekend nights, finished by 8 p.m.\n- **Daylight**: morning coffee on the porch or by the brightest window; walks at lunch when possible.\n\nShe tracks just one number each night -- mood 0-10 -- and sleep quality. After three weeks she notices her Monday anxiety is noticeably lower on weeks with fewer weekend drinks. That's her own personal evidence, and it's more persuasive to her than any study.",
          "visual": {
            "type": "diagram",
            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">DANI&#39;S WEEK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">All four levers, small doses</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"170\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">MOVE</text><text x=\"370\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">3 walks + 2 band sessions</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"290\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"345\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">CONNECT</text><text x=\"370\" y=\"345\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Sister call + coffee with friend</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"410\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"465\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">DRINK</text><text x=\"370\" y=\"465\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Dry Sun-Thu, max 2 by 8 pm</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"530\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"585\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">LIGHT</text><text x=\"370\" y=\"585\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Morning porch coffee</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"690\" width=\"700\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"740\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"20\">Track mood and sleep: build your own evidence</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Personal data makes the levers stick"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "application",
          "title": "Pull One Lever This Week",
          "content": "Don't try to overhaul your life. Pick **one** lever and start today:\n\n1. **Move**: schedule three 15-minute walks this week. Walking, yoga, or strength -- choose what you'll actually do.\n\n2. **Connect**: text one person you've been meaning to reach out to, and suggest a specific time to talk.\n\n3. **Drink less**: try seven alcohol-free days and note your sleep and morning mood. (Daily heavy drinker? Talk to your doctor before stopping.)\n\n4. **Get daylight**: spend 10-20 minutes outside or by a bright window within an hour of waking.\n\n5. **Track one number**: rate your mood 0-10 each night so you can see what works for you.\n\nIf you're in treatment, share your plan with your doctor or therapist -- these levers work best alongside care, not instead of it.",
          "visual": {
            "type": "diagram",
            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">PICK ONE LEVER</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">Start small, start today</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"160\" width=\"800\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">1.</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Three 15-minute walks</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"270\" width=\"800\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">2.</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Text one person, set a time</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"380\" width=\"800\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">3.</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Seven alcohol-free days</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"490\" width=\"800\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">4.</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Daylight within an hour of waking</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"600\" width=\"800\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"650\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">5.</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"650\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Rate your mood 0-10 each night</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"740\" width=\"700\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"790\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"20\">Share the plan with your care team</text></svg>",
            "caption": "One lever, pulled consistently, beats five pulled once"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "quiz",
          "question": "The HUNT study of about 34,000 Norwegian adults linked just one hour of weekly exercise with a lower risk of later depression. What is the most accurate way to interpret this finding?",
          "options": [
            {
              "text": "It proves that one hour of exercise prevents 12% of all depression",
              "correct": false
            },
            {
              "text": "It shows only vigorous exercise protects against depression",
              "correct": false
            },
            {
              "text": "It suggests a protective link, but as an observational study it cannot prove cause",
              "correct": true
            },
            {
              "text": "It is irrelevant because it studied healthy people, not patients",
              "correct": false
            }
          ],
          "explanation": "HUNT was an observational cohort, so it shows an association: people who exercised even an hour a week developed depression less often, and the authors estimated about 12% of cases might be preventable. 'It proves' is the tempting overstatement -- people starting to feel low may already move less, which could explain part of the link. Combined with randomized trials like the 2024 BMJ analysis, though, the evidence points the same direction.",
          "visual": {
            "type": "diagram",
            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"120\" width=\"800\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.1)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">GRADING THE EVIDENCE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">HUNT cohort, about 34,000 adults</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Link or proof?</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"380\" width=\"340\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">OBSERVATIONAL</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Shows a link</text><rect x=\"610\" y=\"380\" width=\"340\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"780\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">RANDOMIZED</text><text x=\"780\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Tests cause</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Know what kind of study you are looking at"
          }
        }
