            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">CLOSING WISDOM</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">The whole book in one sentence</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"250\" width=\"900\" height=\"320\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.1)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"26\">\"Anything that is human is mentionable,</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"390\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"26\">and anything that is mentionable</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"26\">can be more manageable.\"</text><text x=\"950\" y=\"530\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-size=\"20\">-- Fred Rogers</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"660\" width=\"700\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"705\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"20\">Say it out loud -- to yourself, a friend,</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"738\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"20\">a professional. That is where repair begins.</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Naming it is the first repair"
